&lt;h2 id="garden-description">Garden Description&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>To the rear of this house a raised garden (a), three steps up, had a &lt;em>portico&lt;/em> on the east. The &lt;em>portico&lt;/em> was supported by two columns on the east, an engaged column and a pilaster.&lt;/p>
